---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import documents from '../../data/documents.json';
import DocLinks from '../../components/DocLinks.astro';
---
<Layout title_cy="Taliadau Cynghorwyr" title_en="Councillor Payments">
  <div class="page-banner"><h1><span lang="cy">Taliadau Cynghorwyr</span><span lang="en">Councillor Payments</span></h1></div>
  <div class="breadcrumb">
    <a href="/"><span lang="cy">Hafan</span><span lang="en">Home</span></a> &rsaquo;
    <a href="/councillors/"><span lang="cy">Cynghorwyr</span><span lang="en">Councillors</span></a> &rsaquo;
    <span lang="cy">Taliadau</span><span lang="en">Payments</span>
  </div>
  <div class="site-wrap"><div class="content" data-pagefind-body>
    <h2 class="sh"><span lang="cy">Taliadau ac Lwfansau</span><span lang="en">Payments and Allowances</span></h2><hr class="sh-rule">

    <p lang="cy">Yn unol â'r Ddeddf Llywodraeth Leol, mae Cyngor Cymuned Llansannan yn cyhoeddi gwybodaeth am daliadau a wnaed i gynghorwyr.</p>
    <p lang="en">In accordance with the Local Government Act, Llansannan Community Council publishes information about payments made to councillors.</p>

    <h3 class="sub-sh"><span lang="cy">Lwfans Uwch Gyfrifoldeb</span><span lang="en">Senior Responsibility Allowance</span></h3>
    <p lang="cy">Gall y cyngor dalu Lwfans Uwch Gyfrifoldeb i'r Cadeirydd a rolau allweddol eraill. Caiff y penderfyniad hwn ei adolygu'n flynyddol.</p>
    <p lang="en">The council may pay a Senior Responsibility Allowance to the Chair and other key roles. This decision is reviewed annually.</p>

    <div class="minutes-list">
      <div class="minutes-item">
        <div>
          <strong><span lang="cy">Taliadau 2025/26</span><span lang="en">Payments 2025/26</span></strong>
          <div class="fg-meta"><span lang="cy">Blwyddyn ariannol</span><span lang="en">Financial year</span></div>
        </div>
        <DocLinks doc={documents.payments} />
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3 class="sub-sh" style="margin-top:2rem"><span lang="cy">Costau Teithio</span><span lang="en">Travel Expenses</span></h3>
    <p lang="cy">Gall cynghorwyr hawlio costau teithio rhesymol ar gyfer busnes y cyngor yn unol â pholisi treuliau'r cyngor.</p>
    <p lang="en">Councillors may claim reasonable travel costs for council business in accordance with the council's expenses policy.</p>

    <p style="margin-top:1.5rem">
      <a href="/the-council/what-we-spend/"><span lang="cy">Beth rydym yn ei wario →</span><span lang="en">What we spend →</span></a>
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      <a href="/councillors/interests/"><span lang="cy">Cofrestru Buddiannau →</span><span lang="en">Register of Interests →</span></a>
    </p>
  </div></div>
</Layout>
